{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/d5fe5f58cd9cfa3f5d006d52481f71fe.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the Crystal. Save the World.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here in the world of the Blightstone you\u2019ll find deep strategy, blended seamlessly with roguelike progression. Your mission? To protect the Earthglass Crystal, and deliver it to the Infernal Rift. Only by doing this will you be able to destroy the demon overlord Korghul, and shatter the Blightstone itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die, die, and die again. Cunning and keen wit (though looking at our options even a solitary spark of wit will have to suffice) are key to saving this realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to your advantage with objects, enemies and even the weather itself providing strategic opportunities and challenges. Each failure provides invaluable opportunity to learn and collect new skills to help your next adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hold the Line \u2014 Use Every Skill, Trap, and Tactic to Protect the Crystal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/a23d7bbc4d3322a70760aacc90d5e57e.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/53fd588ab91ec24a577f01ef427cbf87.poster.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/53fd588ab91ec24a577f01ef427cbf87.webm?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/53fd588ab91ec24a577f01ef427cbf87.mp4?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dynamic Battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy free movement, without grid-based systems, allowing you to move into strategic cover. Just remember, enemies aren\u2019t restricted by grids either, and there\u2019s always an angle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Environment Is Yours to Command:\u00a0</strong>Hide in long grass or burn it to stop enemies using it for cover. Gather enemies in water to amplify electric attacks. Use every advantage you can get to shatter the Blightstone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harness the Weather to Your Advantage:\u00a0</strong>Dynamic weather will have an impact on Adventurer\u2019s strategies. Dense fog obscures the battlefield, rain will amplify electric attacks and strong winds will affect accuracy. It can bring as many benefits as it does drawbacks, as long as you pay attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/85c81fc8c2418c646edea26ede875193.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/c9a6b5e198a1d72707fba436284feca8.poster.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/c9a6b5e198a1d72707fba436284feca8.webm?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/c9a6b5e198a1d72707fba436284feca8.mp4?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit your heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new heroes and companions to help you along your journey. Chose from Brawler, Hunter, Arcanist, Druid and Priest classes, each with their own unique abilities and companions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a vast skillset:\u00a0</strong>Unlock a wide range of active and passive combat skills for our troop of adventurers and for the Earthglass crystal itself. Mater melee, ranged, area of effect and grappling skills, and combine them for heavy-hitting combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Status effects that sting:\u00a0</strong>Bleeding, poison, binding, stun or burn, dozens of combat conditions can swing the course of each battle. Just remember it won\u2019t always swing your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/a87643571174b91068e4feb07a6af74e.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/aabdd796a859243f59bae642a3ad3277.poster.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/aabdd796a859243f59bae642a3ad3277.webm?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/aabdd796a859243f59bae642a3ad3277.mp4?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy that doesn\u2019t stop when the sun goes down.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers must stay sharp from dawn to dusk, as your party sets up camp each night. Scavenge resources within battles to ensure you have enough to heal and avoid the Blight after the sun falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/1c6b2d2f6e5e00e51cc4e96a965b38f3.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/8af72f59d37f9f1038cd55085030cee1.poster.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/8af72f59d37f9f1038cd55085030cee1.webm?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/8af72f59d37f9f1038cd55085030cee1.mp4?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedural generation means that each journey is different from the last.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As the journey progresses, you will also unravel the story behind the infernal rift, the Earthglass, the Blightstone, and the enemies that you face along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/41c07e8f65003433c268c75fe528d58e.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=115 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"My first time travel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2832280/1fcdc9b50bbfbeeb01965bfeb051715c5bd78829.jpg"},{"name":"Temporal apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2832280/e64e2fea780355e3855e58e07ac8b0f6d9bfbf7a.jpg"},{"name":"A handful of kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2832280/3facda9809f08fec9ce4d3ff416c4bdbd36cf3e9.jpg"},{"name":"A pile of kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2832280/9dfa6b495a33f0ea7994fc267d3e9f16f7382e65.jpg"},{"name":"A mountain of kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2832280/b59fdca20d0365d58c1e285e7e3f0c2da6ef8485.jpg"},{"name":"The crazy bastard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2832280/4e35b8cf6dca2952bb4449a0b28e78845165fec1.jpg"},{"name":"Puppies down","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2832280/9017c397dbaad6200fa212450d898c3b92becfe1.jpg"},{"name":"An insufficient feat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2832280/207d5c8c1b03c9c0cb72523b6f5bdf195bfaffa3.jpg"},{"name":"Bigger they are","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2832280/31d65f1b4c866c07359ae2eb15b18aa70abbf5b2.jpg"},{"name":"Harder they fall","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2832280/2a91f311384a5f6019d6fef177afe56dca0beafb.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2832280?t=1772893844","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772893844","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/2a869177d6100a002d7d2f1c019a72d157ec7813/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772893844","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/2a869177d6100a002d7d2f1c019a72d157ec7813/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772893844","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>The Blightstone Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/3abdd402d308c5137fe698f462416a53.avif?t=1772893844\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras_big/3abdd402d308c5137fe698f462416a53.webp?t=1772893844 width=1560 height=826 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Join Our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/02b282c270b89db92c547a17cefa13e7.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discord: Blightstone\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</strong>\uff5c<strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 X: @blightstonegame</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Reddit:\u00a0r/Blightstone\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </strong>\uff5c<strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 YouTube:\u00a0Unfinished Pixel Channel</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/d5fe5f58cd9cfa3f5d006d52481f71fe.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=250 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Save the Crystal. Save the World.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here in the world of the Blightstone you\u2019ll find deep strategy, blended seamlessly with roguelike progression. Your mission? To protect the Earthglass Crystal, and deliver it to the Infernal Rift. Only by doing this will you be able to destroy the demon overlord Korghul, and shatter the Blightstone itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Die, die, and die again. Cunning and keen wit (though looking at our options even a solitary spark of wit will have to suffice) are key to saving this realm. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the environment to your advantage with objects, enemies and even the weather itself providing strategic opportunities and challenges. Each failure provides invaluable opportunity to learn and collect new skills to help your next adventure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hold the Line \u2014 Use Every Skill, Trap, and Tactic to Protect the Crystal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/a23d7bbc4d3322a70760aacc90d5e57e.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/53fd588ab91ec24a577f01ef427cbf87.poster.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/53fd588ab91ec24a577f01ef427cbf87.webm?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/53fd588ab91ec24a577f01ef427cbf87.mp4?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dynamic Battlefield</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy free movement, without grid-based systems, allowing you to move into strategic cover. Just remember, enemies aren\u2019t restricted by grids either, and there\u2019s always an angle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Environment Is Yours to Command:\u00a0</strong>Hide in long grass or burn it to stop enemies using it for cover. Gather enemies in water to amplify electric attacks. Use every advantage you can get to shatter the Blightstone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Harness the Weather to Your Advantage:\u00a0</strong>Dynamic weather will have an impact on Adventurer\u2019s strategies. Dense fog obscures the battlefield, rain will amplify electric attacks and strong winds will affect accuracy. It can bring as many benefits as it does drawbacks, as long as you pay attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/85c81fc8c2418c646edea26ede875193.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/c9a6b5e198a1d72707fba436284feca8.poster.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/c9a6b5e198a1d72707fba436284feca8.webm?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/c9a6b5e198a1d72707fba436284feca8.mp4?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Recruit your heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new heroes and companions to help you along your journey. Chose from Brawler, Hunter, Arcanist, Druid and Priest classes, each with their own unique abilities and companions.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master a vast skillset:\u00a0</strong>Unlock a wide range of active and passive combat skills for our troop of adventurers and for the Earthglass crystal itself. Mater melee, ranged, area of effect and grappling skills, and combine them for heavy-hitting combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Status effects that sting:\u00a0</strong>Bleeding, poison, binding, stun or burn, dozens of combat conditions can swing the course of each battle. Just remember it won\u2019t always swing your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/a87643571174b91068e4feb07a6af74e.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/aabdd796a859243f59bae642a3ad3277.poster.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/aabdd796a859243f59bae642a3ad3277.webm?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/aabdd796a859243f59bae642a3ad3277.mp4?t=1772893844\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategy that doesn\u2019t stop when the sun goes down.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventurers must stay sharp from dawn to dusk, as your party sets up camp each night. Scavenge resources within battles to ensure you have enough to heal and avoid the Blight after the sun falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/1c6b2d2f6e5e00e51cc4e96a965b38f3.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/8af72f59d37f9f1038cd55085030cee1.poster.avif?t=1772893844\" width=616 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2832280/extras/8af72f59d37f9